artifact: pytest (MIT), ruff (MIT), bandit (Apache-2.0), detect-secrets (Apache-2.0) and pip-audit
(Apache-2.0), with their dependencies; checkov (Apache-2.0) is pinned in the CI workflow.

The prompt in src/prompts/oncall_orchestration.yaml is original text written for this sample and is
covered by this repository's MIT-0 license. It keeps the variable placeholders and the assistant
message prefill that the Amazon Connect orchestration AI prompt type requires, which are a format
contract rather than copyrightable text. The file carries no license header because it is sent to
the service verbatim as the prompt.

